"""Generic keyed 2×10 2.54 mm right-angle IDC box header.

BOOMELE C9144 is the selected JLCPCB through-hole catalogue part. Its
manufacturer drawing specifies a 2.54 mm row and column grid with 1.0 mm PCB
holes, matching KiCad's stock IDC-Header_2x10_P2.54mm_Horizontal land pattern
used here. The matching KiCad STEP model is embedded in the footprint.
"""

